    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "William decide to rejects The King's offer and destroys the ritual painting.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PlaySound",
      "sound": "glass_shattering_piercing"
    },
    {
      "name": "ChangeBackground",
      "background": "yellow_void_light_collapsing"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A piercing sound like shattering glass echoes through the yellow void, and the blinding light begins to collapse.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "The King",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You choose the wound over the balm, and the ruin over the rose. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Very well. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "The candle burns low, but it does not die. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet the empty chairs will not be forgotten. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall wait for you at every table, in every house, until you learn to sit among them. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Farewell, the play will find another stage.",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The sickly yellow sky dissolves into darkness, and the heavy pull of the abyss slowly fades away.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ChangeBackground",
      "background": "ritual_room_moonlight_broken_windows"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "William's mind returns from Carcosa. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "William looks around; his surroundings begin returning to normal, the mask is shattered, and the old wounds still remain.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The rotting ritual room of Blackwood Manor is quiet once more, lit only by the faint moonlight filtering through the broken windows.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He steps out of the room and looks over the place, picturing his family, the trauma, and the wounds from the past. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "For the first time, he no longer runs from the ghosts of what happened here, he carries the weight of it all as he walks toward the front doors. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Even though the actor refused his stage, there will always be another story waiting to unravel.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "CameraMove",
      "action": "pull_back_out_of_hallway_past_manor_walls_into_void"
    },
    {
      "name": "ChangeBackground",
      "background": "black_void_tall_yellow_figure"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Slowly, the camera pulls back, drifting out of the shadowy hallway, past the decaying walls of the manor, and out into an endless, pitch-black void where a tall yellow figure stands.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "CameraMove",
      "action": "zoom_out"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "revealing that the narrator is actually The King in Yellow himself, reading calmly from the script he holds in his hands.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadSprite",
      "speaker": "The King",
      "expression": "normal",
      "position": "center"
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The King slowly closes the pages, turning his faceless, hooded gaze directly toward the screen.",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoadText",
      "speaker": "The King",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I have told thee of the house, of the hearth gone cold, and of the sorrow that sleeps in its walls. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "But a story is never only what is told. ",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "There is another twist behind the curtain, and soon the players shall step into the light.",
          "pacing": 0.06,
          "style": "normal",
          "pause_after": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
